OL,3,ANato chief vows defence against space
OL,4,Athreat after Russian nuclear satellite
OL,5,Areports
OL,6,
OL,7,FNato chief Mark Rutte has said the
OL,8,Falliance will defend against any
OL,9,Fthreats in space after German reports
OL,10,Fthat Russia is preparing to launch a
OL,11,Fnuclear-armed satellite.
OL,13,FIntelligence reports about a possible
OL,14,Flaunch in the next 60 days had been
OL,15,Fshared among Nato countries this month,
OL,16,Faccording to German media. It was not
OL,17,Fclear which country had authored the
OL,18,Freports.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
